<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>E-Healthcare · Care, connected</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/css/app.css"></head><body><header class="public-nav"><a class="brand" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/"><span class="brand-mark">+</span><span>e-healthcare<small>CLINIC MANAGER</small></span></a><nav class="actions"><a class="btn" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login">Sign in</a><a class="btn primary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Get started →</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">PERSONAL HEALTHCARE. SIMPLY CONNECTED.</span><h1>A healthier way<br>to stay connected.</h1><p>More time for your health. Less time on paperwork. Connect with your doctor and keep every part of your care in one place.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Find your next appointment →</a><a class="btn" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/doctors">Explore our doctors</a></div></div><div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Your connected care" style="border: 2px solid var(--mint-dark); box-shadow: 0 10px 40px #087d7920;"><div class="card"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CARE, ALL TOGETHER</span><h3>Every step. A little simpler.</h3><div class="quick-action"><span class="avatar">01</span><div><strong>Find the right doctor</strong><small>Choose a specialty and an available time.</small></div></div><div class="quick-action"><span class="avatar">02</span><div><strong>Make room for your health</strong><small>Manage your visits with a few clicks.</small></div></div><div class="quick-action"><span class="avatar">03</span><div><strong>Keep your story together</strong><small>Your records, securely organized.</small></div></div></div></div></section><section class="feature-grid" style="padding: 0 35px;"><article class="card card-pad"><span class="eyebrow">01 / APPOINTMENTS</span><h3>Care that fits your day</h3><p>Find real available appointments, book a visit, and keep track of what comes next.</p></article><article class="card card-pad"><span class="eyebrow">02 / MEDICAL RECORDS</span><h3>Your history, within reach</h3><p>Securely store your reports and review consultation notes in your patient portal.</p></article><article class="card card-pad"><span class="eyebrow">03 / CONNECTED CLINIC</span><h3>A calmer clinic experience</h3><p>Connected schedules and patient queues help your care team stay organized.</p></article></section></main><footer class="public-nav muted" style="font-size:11px">E-Healthcare Clinic Manager <span>For emergencies, contact local emergency services immediately.</span></footer></body></html>
